OL,3,GNEWSABlaze at former airfield now
OL,4,A'under control'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA warehouse fire at a former airfield
OL,7,Fin Leicestershire has been brought
OL,8,Flargely under control, the fire service
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FMultiple crews remain at the scene at
OL,12,FBruntingthorpe Airfield, a former RAF
OL,13,Fbase which is now used as a vehicle
OL,14,Ftest track and storage facility.
OL,16,FGraham Vaux, area manager at
OL,17,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service,
OL,18,Fsaid the service was called just after
OL,19,F08:00 BST on Friday to a fire in a
OL,20,Fwarehouse that was being used as a
OL,21,Fspray booth.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
